flowchart TD
    Q([user question]) --> SAFE{{safety<br/>LLM crisis check}}
    SAFE -->|high risk| CRISIS[crisis response]:::stop
    SAFE -->|ok| COND[condense<br/>rewrite as standalone question<br/>using chat history]
    COND --> PLAN[plan<br/>split into 1–3 sub-questions]
    PLAN --> RET

    subgraph RET [retrieve · runs per sub-question]
        direction TB
        CLS[router: classify path<br/>graph_rag / naive_rag / both<br/>+ extract entity] --> R1[graph traversal<br/>and / or vector search]
        R1 --> GR1{relevance<br/>grader}
        GR1 -->|correct| KEEP[keep context]:::ok
        GR1 -->|weak| ALT[try the other path]
        ALT --> GR2{relevance<br/>grader}
        GR2 -->|correct| KEEP
        GR2 -->|weak| WEB[web search<br/>vet → chunk → embed → Pinecone]
        WEB --> GR3{relevance<br/>grader}
        GR3 -->|correct| KEEP
        GR3 -->|off-topic| NA[no_answer]:::stop
    end

    RET --> SYN[synthesize<br/>answer from retrieved context only<br/>· cites graph vs. text · refuses to guess]
    SYN --> A([answer + sources])
    CRISIS --> A

    classDef stop fill:#fde2e2,stroke:#e57373,color:#7a1f1f;
    classDef ok fill:#e2f5e9,stroke:#66bb6a,color:#1b5e20;
